{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Baked Surface Detail for Low-Poly Assets.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Baked Surface Detail for Low-Poly Assets.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"baked surface detail for low poly assets baked surface detail for low poly assets","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Baked Surface Detail for Low-Poly Assets.md","fileName":"Baked Surface Detail for Low-Poly Assets.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Baked Surface Detail for Low-Poly Assets","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-14 01:18\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Low-Poly Game Environment Art]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Low-Poly Game Environment Art","creatinggameenvironmentsinblender3d.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Baked Surface Detail for Low-Poly Assets.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Baked Surface Detail for Low-Poly Assets.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"baked surface detail for low poly assets baked surface detail for low poly assets","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Baked Surface Detail for Low-Poly Assets.md","fileName":"Baked Surface Detail for Low-Poly Assets.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Baked Surface Detail for Low-Poly Assets","heading":"Baked Surface Detail for Low-Poly Assets","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Baking transfers aspects of a high-resolution surface into texture maps used by a lower-resolution mesh. Normal or bump information can make lighting suggest small relief without retaining every sculpted polygon at runtime.\n\nThe low-poly mesh still needs clean silhouette and shading topology, while the high-poly source supplies fine surface character. A compatible UV layout and consistent projection relationship are necessary for the baked detail to align after export.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Low-Poly Game Enviro